  "title": "Dairy and Gluten-Free 'Buttermilk Pancakes'",
  "description": "These pancakes are made with sweet rice flour, soy yogurt, soy milk, and eggs. Get the sweet rice flour at the natural foods store.",
  "authors": [
    "CT Kelly"
  ],
